  1008                                  ; Completed POST tone through the real PIT channel 2 -> port 61h -> speaker
  1009                                  ; path.  Count hardware OUT2 transitions so the tone duration follows emulated
  1010                                  ; motherboard time instead of an arbitrary host delay loop.
