  5658                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  5659                                  ; Cromwell AT CMOS Setup
  5660                                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  5661                                  ; The setup program lives in the system ROM, as it did on late AT-compatible
  5662                                  ; motherboards. CMOS byte 20h is OEM configuration RAM covered by the normal
  5663                                  ; 10h-20h checksum: bit 0 is boot Num Lock, bit 1 selects HDD-first boot,
  5664                                  ; bit 2 selects Fast POST memory test, and bit 3 controls keyboard-error halt.
  5665                                  
  5666                                  setup_entry_window:
  5667 00002A01 50                          push ax
